{"title": "Perform (Lyre)", "pageid": 31762, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Perform_(Lyre)", "categories": ["Class actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Perform_(disambiguation)\" title=\"Perform (disambiguation)\">Perform (disambiguation)</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Perform_Lyre.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5c/Perform_Lyre.webp/300px-Perform_Lyre.webp, /w/images/5/5c/Perform_Lyre.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5c/Perform_Lyre.webp/300px-Perform_Lyre.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5c/Perform_Lyre.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Perform</b> is a free action that allows the user to play a tune using a <a href=\"/wiki/Lyre\" title=\"Lyre\">Lyre</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Play an enchanting crowd-pleaser to attract and delight those around you.\n</p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_Bard_Perform_Lyre</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Bard_Perform_Lyre\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Bard_Perform_Lyre\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=DontAbortPerforming_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"DontAbortPerforming (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">DontAbortPerforming</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsLinkedSpellContainer_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsLinkedSpellContainer (spell flag)\">IsLinkedSpellContainer</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variants\"> Variants </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Perform_%27Bard_Dance%27\" title=\"Perform 'Bard Dance'\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Perform_%27Bard_Dance%27_Icon.webp/40px-Perform_%27Bard_Dance%27_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Perform_%27Bard_Dance%27_Icon.webp/60px-Perform_%27Bard_Dance%27_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Perform_%27Bard_Dance%27_Icon.webp/80px-Perform_%27Bard_Dance%27_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Perform 'Bard Dance'\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Perform_%27Bard_Dance%27_Icon.webp/40px-Perform_%27Bard_Dance%27_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/74/Perform_%27Bard_Dance%27_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Perform_%27Bard_Dance%27\" title=\"Perform 'Bard Dance'\">Perform 'Bard Dance'</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Perform_%27Of_Divinity_and_Sin%27\" title=\"Perform 'Of Divinity and Sin'\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Perform_%27Of_Divinity_and_Sin%27_Icon.webp/40px-Perform_%27Of_Divinity_and_Sin%27_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f9/Perform_%27Of_Divinity_and_Sin%27_Icon.webp/60px-Perform_%27Of_Divinity_and_Sin%27_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f9/Perform_%27Of_Divinity_and_Sin%27_Icon.webp/80px-Perform_%27Of_Divinity_and_Sin%27_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Perform 'Of Divinity and Sin'\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Perform_%27Of_Divinity_and_Sin%27_Icon.webp/40px-Perform_%27Of_Divinity_and_Sin%27_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f9/Perform_%27Of_Divinity_and_Sin%27_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Perform_%27Of_Divinity_and_Sin%27\" title=\"Perform 'Of Divinity and Sin'\">Perform 'Of Divinity and Sin'</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Perform_%27Old_Time_Battles%27\" title=\"Perform 'Old Time Battles'\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Perform_%27Old_Time_Battles%27_Icon.webp/40px-Perform_%27Old_Time_Battles%27_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/58/Perform_%27Old_Time_Battles%27_Icon.webp/60px-Perform_%27Old_Time_Battles%27_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/58/Perform_%27Old_Time_Battles%27_Icon.webp/80px-Perform_%27Old_Time_Battles%27_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Perform 'Old Time Battles'\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Perform_%27Old_Time_Battles%27_Icon.webp/40px-Perform_%27Old_Time_Battles%27_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/58/Perform_%27Old_Time_Battles%27_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Perform_%27Old_Time_Battles%27\" title=\"Perform 'Old Time Battles'\">Perform 'Old Time Battles'</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Perform_%27The_Power%27\" title=\"Perform 'The Power'\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/43/Perform_%27The_Power%27_Icon.webp/40px-Perform_%27The_Power%27_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/43/Perform_%27The_Power%27_Icon.webp/60px-Perform_%27The_Power%27_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/43/Perform_%27The_Power%27_Icon.webp/80px-Perform_%27The_Power%27_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Perform 'The Power'\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/43/Perform_%27The_Power%27_Icon.webp/40px-Perform_%27The_Power%27_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/43/Perform_%27The_Power%27_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Perform_%27The_Power%27\" title=\"Perform 'The Power'\">Perform 'The Power'</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Perform_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27\" title=\"Perform 'The Queen's High Seas'\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Perform_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27_Icon.webp/40px-Perform_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Perform_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27_Icon.webp/60px-Perform_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Perform_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27_Icon.webp/80px-Perform_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Perform 'The Queen's High Seas'\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Perform_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27_Icon.webp/40px-Perform_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6b/Perform_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Perform_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27\" title=\"Perform 'The Queen's High Seas'\">Perform 'The Queen's High Seas'</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Perform_%27Sing_for_Me%27\" title=\"Perform 'Sing for Me'\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Perform_%27Sing_for_Me%27_Icon.webp/40px-Perform_%27Sing_for_Me%27_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Perform_%27Sing_for_Me%27_Icon.webp/60px-Perform_%27Sing_for_Me%27_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Perform_%27Sing_for_Me%27_Icon.webp/80px-Perform_%27Sing_for_Me%27_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Perform 'Sing for Me'\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Perform_%27Sing_for_Me%27_Icon.webp/40px-Perform_%27Sing_for_Me%27_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4f/Perform_%27Sing_for_Me%27_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Perform_%27Sing_for_Me%27\" title=\"Perform 'Sing for Me'\">Perform 'Sing for Me'</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre\" title=\"Play the Spider's Lyre\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.webp/40px-Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.webp/60px-Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.webp/80px-Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Play the Spider's Lyre\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.webp/40px-Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c4/Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre\" title=\"Play the Spider's Lyre\">Play the Spider's Lyre</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Succeed one of two <a href=\"/wiki/Performance\" title=\"Performance\">Performance</a> checks with <a href=\"/wiki/Alfira\" title=\"Alfira\">Alfira</a> while she is writing a song in the <a href=\"/wiki/Emerald_Grove\" title=\"Emerald Grove\">Emerald Grove</a> to gain Musical Instrument proficiency.</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>If multiple characters use the Perform action, they sync up and play together. Also nearby bards, such as in the <a href=\"/wiki/Circus_of_the_Last_Days\" title=\"Circus of the Last Days\">Circus of the Last Days</a>, can join the performance.\n<ul><li>If multiple characters perform the same song, the individual instruments can be heard together as the song is played (e.g., <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lute\" title=\"Lute\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e4/Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lute\" title=\"Lute\">lute</a> and <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Violin\" title=\"Violin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Instrument_Violin_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Instrument_Violin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Instrument_Violin_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Instrument_Violin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Instrument_Violin_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Instrument_Violin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Instrument_Violin_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Instrument_Violin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Instrument_Violin_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Violin\" title=\"Violin\">violin</a>).</li>\n<li>Multiple instruments are more easily heard if ambient volume in the game's audio settings is moved to or near zero.\n<ul><li>A harmonious example of multiple instruments can occur after Ketheric Thorm's defeat, when a player character on the violin joins Alfira on her lute to perform for the tiefling children.</li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li>Nearby NPCs gather to hear the performance and focus their attention on the performer(s). This can create an opportunity for pickpocketing and thievery. Many patrolling NPCs cannot be distracted this way.</li>\n<li>If the performer has <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency#Instrument_proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">musical instrument proficiency</a>, they make a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Performance\" title=\"Performance\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Performance_Icon.png/25px-Performance_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Performance_Icon.png/38px-Performance_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Performance_Icon.png/50px-Performance_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Performance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Performance_Icon.png/25px-Performance_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Performance_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Performance\" title=\"Performance\">Performance</a> check. If successful, the gathered audience tips the performer with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Toss_a_Coin\" title=\"Toss a Coin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Toss_a_Coin_Icon.webp/20px-Toss_a_Coin_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Toss_a_Coin_Icon.webp/30px-Toss_a_Coin_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Toss_a_Coin_Icon.webp/40px-Toss_a_Coin_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Toss a Coin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Toss_a_Coin_Icon.webp/20px-Toss_a_Coin_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a9/Toss_a_Coin_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Toss_a_Coin\" title=\"Toss a Coin\">Toss a Coin</a> when the performance ends. However, a successful performance does not necessarily result in every attendee tipping the performer(s).</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Difficulty_Class\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Difficulty Class\">Difficulty Class</a> of the performance check scales with the size of the audience:\n<ul><li>1 audience member: DC 10</li>\n<li>2-3 audience members: DC 12</li>\n<li>4-5 audience members: DC 15</li>\n<li>6-7 audience members: DC 18</li>\n<li>8+ audience members: DC 20</li></ul></li>\n<li>Any character can use the Perform action with an instrument equipped. However, a character without instrument proficiency makes a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poor_Performance_(Condition)\" title=\"Poor Performance (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poor Performance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/de/Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Poor_Performance_(Condition)\" title=\"Poor Performance (Condition)\">Poor Performance</a> when doing so. This provokes annoyed reactions from the audience who will leave immediately.</li>\n<li>Perform is a free action, and can be used during battle. The performance ends if the performing character is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Threatened_(Condition)\" title=\"Threatened (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Threatened\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Threatened_(Condition)\" title=\"Threatened (Condition)\">Threatened</a>.</li></ul>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre\" title=\"Play the Spider's Lyre\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.webp/25px-Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.webp/38px-Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.webp/50px-Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Play the Spider's Lyre\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.webp/25px-Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c4/Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre\" title=\"Play the Spider's Lyre\">Play the Spider's Lyre</a> is only available from the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spider%27s_Lyre\" title=\"Spider's Lyre\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Instrument_Spider%27s_Lyre_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Instrument_Spider%27s_Lyre_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Instrument_Spider%27s_Lyre_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Instrument_Spider%27s_Lyre_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Instrument_Spider%27s_Lyre_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Instrument_Spider%27s_Lyre_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Instrument_Spider%27s_Lyre_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Instrument_Spider%27s_Lyre_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Instrument_Spider%27s_Lyre_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spider%27s_Lyre\" title=\"Spider's Lyre\">Spider's Lyre</a></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Achievements\">Achievements</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-achievement\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; width: 100%; min-width: 10em; max-width: 45em; align-items: center; padding: 0 1em;\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-achievement\" style=\"max-width: 80px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Achievements\" title=\"Achievements\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/7/72/A-Busker.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/72/A-Busker.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-achievement\" style=\"margin: 0 auto 0 0; padding: 0 0.8em; text-align:left;\">\n<dl><dt>Busker</dt>\n<dd>Earn a hundred gold from playing sweet, sweet music in a single playthrough.</dd></dl>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715035239\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.099 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.105 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5258/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 58473/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 23547/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 23/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 34/1000\nLua time usage: 0.045/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1467709/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   87.514      1 -total\n 98.59%   86.281      1 Template:Feature_page\n 65.03%   56.914     61 Template:Trim\n 21.60%   18.904     12 Template:Icon_link\n 20.44%   17.886     12 Template:Icon_text\n 16.18%   14.157      8 Template:SAI\n 15.51%   13.575      3 Template:Item_icon\n 14.73%   12.894      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 12.91%   11.294      2 Template:SmRarityItem\n 12.27%   10.737      2 Template:SmCond\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:31762-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715035239 and revision id 316453. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}